<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1983786530"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1646612871"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="結い結われ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="nayuta"/><amll:meta key="album" value="結い結われ"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:09.453"><div begin="00:36.809" end="04:42.888"><p begin="00:36.809" end="00:38.941" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">何もない私<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一无所有的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni mo na i wa ta shi</span></p><p begin="00:40.463" end="00:45.045" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">君が教えてくれたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是你告诉了我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ga o shi e te ku re ta n da</span></p><p begin="00:46.387" end="00:49.319" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">ここにいて良い、と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我可以留在这里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ni i te i i to</span></p><p begin="00:53.220" end="00:55.434" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">あの日<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要告诉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no hi u ma re ta wa ta shi ni</span></p><p begin="00:56.370" end="01:01.436" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">生まれた私に伝えたい</p><p begin="01:02.586" end="01:06.502" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">刻む、時とともに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在铭刻时间的同时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki za mu to ki to to mo ni</span></p><p begin="01:07.461" end="01:07.878" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">結い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彼此间便产生了交集</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu i yu wa re te yu ku</span></p><p begin="01:08.055" end="01:11.403" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">結われてゆく<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu i yu wa re te yu ku</span></p><p begin="01:16.892" end="01:18.810" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">忘れないでいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re na i de i te</span></p><p begin="01:19.153" end="01:21.068" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">私 きっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一定仍会放声歌唱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ki 't to u ta u ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:21.969" end="01:23.619" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">歌うから</p><p begin="01:24.857" end="01:28.339" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">出逢えた軌跡の先に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为相逢的轨迹的前方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de a e ta ki se ki no sa ki ni</span></p><p begin="01:29.304" end="01:32.214" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">道標を灯すだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">点亮指名前路的路标</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi chi shi ru be wo to mo su da ro u</span></p><p begin="01:32.770" end="01:36.666" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">答えのない道を行く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奔赴那条无解的道路</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ta e no na i mi chi wo yu ku</span></p><p begin="01:38.073" end="01:39.272" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">遠く 遠く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">远处呼唤着彼此的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to o ku to o ku yo bi a 't ta ko e</span></p><p begin="01:39.692" end="01:41.425" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">呼び合った声<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to o ku to o ku yo bi a 't ta ko e</span></p><p begin="01:42.114" end="01:45.564" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">もし終わりが来ても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便终焉到来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo shi o wa ri ga ki te mo</span></p><p begin="01:47.108" end="01:49.609" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">輝き続けて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也请继续闪耀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ga ya ki tsu zu ke te</span></p><p begin="02:05.556" end="02:07.806" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">ゼロからイチへと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从无到有</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze ro ka ra i chi he to</span></p><p begin="02:09.044" end="02:13.824" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">何かを変えていくことを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">面对变化</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni ka wo ka e te i ku ko to wo</span></p><p begin="02:15.258" end="02:18.209" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">怖がらないで、と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再也无需恐惧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko wa ga ra na i de to</span></p><p begin="02:22.149" end="02:24.184" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">空に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望驰骋向天际的思念终能实现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ra ni ha se ta o mo i ga ka na u yo u ni</span></p><p begin="02:25.384" end="02:29.884" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">馳せた想いが叶うように</p><p begin="02:31.523" end="02:35.278" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">祈り、時を越えて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">祈祷将会跨越时空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i no ri to ki wo ko e te</span></p><p begin="02:36.395" end="02:36.728" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">結い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将彼此连结在一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu i yu wa re te yu ku</span></p><p begin="02:37.039" end="02:40.121" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">結われてゆく<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu i yu wa re te yu ku</span></p><p begin="02:45.749" end="02:47.599" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">今を生きていって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请你好好活在当下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma wo i ki te i 't te</span></p><p begin="02:47.888" end="02:49.239" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">私 ずっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会永远如此歌唱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi zu 't to u ta u ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:50.619" end="02:52.556" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">歌うから</p><p begin="02:53.488" end="02:57.191" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">まだ見ぬ君に逢いたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要与素未谋面的你相见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da mi nu ki mi ni a i ta i</span></p><p begin="02:58.069" end="03:00.616" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">心の奥照らすまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直至那束光照亮内心深处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro no o ku te ra su ma de</span></p><p begin="03:01.438" end="03:05.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">偽りない道を行く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奔赴那条真实无伪的道路</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu wa ri na i mi chi wo yu ku</span></p><p begin="03:06.975" end="03:08.025" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">巡り 巡り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断吸引着彼此的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me gu ri me gu ri hi ki a 't ta ko e</span></p><p begin="03:08.653" end="03:09.659" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">引き合った</p><p begin="03:09.854" end="03:10.287" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">声<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便终焉到来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo shi o wa ri ga ki te mo</span></p><p begin="03:10.964" end="03:14.198" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">もし終わりが来ても<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo shi o wa ri ga ki te mo</span></p><p begin="03:15.809" end="03:18.491" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">互いに信じて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也请相信彼此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ga i ni shi n ji te</span></p><p begin="03:34.879" end="03:38.596" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">君がいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为有你 我才能成为真正的自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ga i te wa ta shi ga wa ta shi de i ra re ta</span></p><p begin="03:39.082" end="03:42.924" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">私が私で</p><p begin="03:44.023" end="03:47.137" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">いられた</p><p begin="03:48.485" end="03:49.152" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">だから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 努力活下去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra i ki te i ko u</span></p><p begin="03:50.421" end="03:52.771" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">生きていこう</p><p begin="03:54.094" end="03:56.594" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">いつだって君と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论何时 都能与你一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu da 't te ki mi to</span></p><p begin="03:57.616" end="03:59.662" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">ここから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从这里重新开始</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ka ra ha ji ma ru</span></p><p begin="04:01.603" end="04:04.012" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">始まる</p><p begin="04:10.439" end="04:12.205" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">忘れないでいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re na i de i te</span></p><p begin="04:12.661" end="04:17.028" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">私ずっと歌うから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会永远歌唱不止</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi zu 't to u ta u ka ra</span></p><p begin="04:18.148" end="04:21.834" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">出逢えた奇跡の先に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相逢的奇迹的前方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de a e ta ki se ki no sa ki ni</span></p><p begin="04:22.688" end="04:25.403" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">物語は続くだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">故事仍旧未完待续</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo no ga ta ri wa tsu zu ku da ro u</span></p><p begin="04:26.494" end="04:30.464" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">答えのない道を行く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奔赴那条无解的道路</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ta e no na i mi chi wo yu ku</span></p><p begin="04:31.507" end="04:32.689" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">遠く 遠く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">远处呼唤着彼此的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to o ku to o ku yo bi a 't ta ko e</span></p><p begin="04:33.416" end="04:34.265" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">呼び合った</p><p begin="04:34.699" end="04:34.984" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">声<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便终焉到来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo shi o wa ri ga ki te mo</span></p><p begin="04:35.528" end="04:39.078" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">もし終わりが来ても<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo shi o wa ri ga ki te mo</span></p><p begin="04:40.539" end="04:42.888" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">幸せだったよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也的的确确曾有幸福降临</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi a wa se da 't ta yo</span></p></div></body></tt>